cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CUATRO"
abstract: >-
  Tiered viral sequence detection for metagenomic contigs. CUATRO combines
  four classifiers - VirSorter2 and geNomad for marker-gene content, Deep6 and
  ViraLM for sequence composition - and assigns each contig to one of four
  confidence tiers.
